---
import { settings, todo, telHref } from "../lib/content";
---
<section class="sec cream" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap faq">
    <div class="l"><div class="bar"></div><h2 class="h2">Before you visit</h2>
      <div class="rules"><strong style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:22px;font-weight:600">House rules</strong>
        <ol><li>Wash or sanitise your hands when you arrive.</li><li>Let the cats come to you, and be gentle.</li><li>No picking up, holding or restraining the cats.</li><li>Never wake or stroke a sleeping cat.</li><li>Quiet voices, and no running.</li><li>No feeding the cats, and keep food covered.</li><li>No toys or catnip from home.</li><li>Flash off when taking photos.</li><li>Staff open and close the doors.</li></ol></div>
    </div>
    <div class="r"><details open><summary>Can children visit?</summary><p>Yes, children aged {settings.rules?.minAge ?? 5} and over are welcome with an adult, and every child must be supervised. We allow up to {settings.rules?.maxChildren ?? 6} children at a time, so please give their ages when you book.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need to book?</summary><p>Booking is advised as we only take {settings.rules?.maxGuests ?? 15} guests at a time. Sundays are bookings only.</p></details><details><summary>What does the entry fee cover?</summary><p>One hour with the cats. It helps pay for their food, toys and care. Food and drinks are bought separately once you're inside.</p></details><details><summary>Can I get a refund?</summary><p>All payments for entry, food, drinks and other purchases are non-refundable. {todo(settings.rules?.rescheduling, "Rescheduling policy to confirm.")}</p></details><details><summary>I have a cat allergy. Can I visit?</summary><p>Our cats roam freely. Air purifiers help, but allergens are still present, so please enter at your own risk and bring any medication you need.</p></details><details><summary>Can I pick up the cats?</summary><p>Please don't. Let the cats come to you and stop when they walk away. Staff will show you how to play with them.</p></details><details><summary>Can I take photos?</summary><p>Of course. Please turn your flash off.</p></details><details><summary>Can I just get a takeaway?</summary><p>Yes. Use our takeaway hatch for drinks and food, £3.50 each.</p></details><details><summary>Is there a disclaimer to sign?</summary><p>Yes, everyone agrees to our visitor disclaimer and house rules when booking online.</p></details><div class="ctaline"><button class="btn book" data-book type="button">Ready? Book a visit</button></div></div>
  </div>
</section>
